00৳","single":"","tax":"Ex Tax: 2,000৳","discounts":[]},"request":false,"askText":"","stepperHidden":false,"productId":"713","features":{"title":"Key Features","items":[{"h":"Model: HP JD092B","c":[]},{"h":"Series: HP X130","c":[]},{"h":"Form Factor: SFP+","c":[]},{"h":"Data Rate: 10Gbps","c":[]},{"h":"Connector Type: LC Duplex","c":[]},{"h":"Fiber Type: Multimode Fiber (MMF)","c":[]},{"h":"Wavelength: 850nm","c":[]},{"h":"Max Distance: Up to 300m (OM3 MMF)","c":[]},{"h":"Warranty: 01 Year","c":[]}],"noExpand":false},"tabs":[{"title":"Description","active":true,"cls":"tab-2","noExpand":false,"kind":"description","html":"\n                <p>The HP JD092B X130 10G SFP+ LC SR Transceiver is a high-performance 10 Gigabit optical module designed for reliable and high-speed data transmission over multimode fiber (MMF). Engineered for enterprise networking, data centers, and telecom infrastructure, this SFP+ transceiver provides stable connectivity with low power consumption and excellent compatibility with HP networking equipment.</p><p><br></p><p>Supporting up to 10Gbps data transfer rates, the HP JD092B uses an LC duplex connector and operates over 850nm wavelength, delivering transmission distances up to 300 meters on OM3 multimode fiber. Its hot-pluggable SFP+ form factor allows easy installation and maintenance without network downtime.</p><p><br></p><p>Ideal for switches, routers, servers, and storage networking, the HP X130 10G SFP+ SR module ensures efficient high-speed communication for modern business environments in Bangladesh.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features</h3><p><br></p><ul><li>Supports 10Gbps high-speed data transmission</li><li>SFP+ hot-pluggable form factor</li><li>LC duplex connector interface</li><li>850nm wavelength for multimode fiber</li><li>Up to 300m transmission distance on OM3 MMF</li><li>Low power consumption and stable performance</li><li>Compatible with HP networking devices</li><li>Ideal for enterprise and data center applications</li></ul>\